msgstr "On activation, the plugin uses your live key to check whether Mollie offers iDEAL and SEPA direct debit live. If that fails, nothing changes. Activation applies only to this website at this address; a copy of the site can never collect payments."

#: src/Admin.php:1017
msgid "Bij uninstall opruimen, uitsluitend wanneer extern veilig en bewaarbeleid dit toestaat"
msgstr "Clean up on uninstall, only when external safety and retention policy allow it"

